{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかーあ\n誕生日おめでとう。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんどいっぱいお喋りしよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な15歳になりますように。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は個別握手会in横浜っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さんありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりー！\nいつもありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の方も、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましてー！\n今日はありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って方も、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりみんな嬉しいよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"９月まで握手会ないのが寂しいけど\nまた会えるの楽しみにしてます\\( ^ω^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして服装はっ\nビビットブルーのワンピースに\n監督巻き！うん。安定。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽいって言われて照れた(●´-` ●)\nみんなありがとう(●´-` ●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして久しぶりにネイルまでしちゃった(●´-` ●)ぴーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サーモンピンクっっ\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネイルなんて夏休みの特権だよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また来てくれるのを楽しみにしてるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズ！\n前回の！！\n結果発表！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見やすいように同率はまとめました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 かなりん\n2位 みなみ\n3位 ねね\n4位 ひなちま\n5位 若月\nかずみん\n7位 ななみん\n8位 れなりん\nあすか\nさゆにゃん\nせいたん\n真夏\nちはる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんねーかなりんだけねー\nダントツすぎてねートップだったー\nびっくりしたもの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆことでーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねころ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くっくっくっ\n本気を出せばわたしは強いのじゃ！\nほっほっほっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......それでも見抜くとは、、\n強者じゃな。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななめっておる。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、リハだったり仕事だったり撮影だったりで\n家で全然ご飯食べれてなくて(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今日久しぶりに家族４人揃って\n家で食卓囲んでご飯食べれて(´;ω;`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後はみんなでハリーポッター観たり談笑して(´;ω;`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前のことのはずなのに、\nなんだか懐かしくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり家族って大事なんだな、って改めて思ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せだな、って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喧嘩することも、反抗することも\nたまにあるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでもずっと影で応援してくれてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな家族がだいすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ。やばい。なんでだろ。\nこんな文章書いてたらなんだか泣けてきちゃったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり家族と過ごせない日々が知らず知らずのうちに\n淋しかったのかもしれないな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも支えてくれてありがとう。\nこれからもよろしくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........なんだか急に伝えたくなりました。笑( ´_ゝ`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文章ぐちゃぐちゃだけどたまには語らせてね。笑( ´_ゝ`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/08/11/3313068/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし。この余韻のまま。寝る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のリハも頑張って来る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"}